# Cloudflare redirects — Panda Wok
# Only real 301 aliases live here. Next.js owns routing for everything else, so
# there is deliberately no SPA catch-all: on Workers a `/*  /:splat 200` rewrite
# resolves against static assets and turns every dynamic route into a 404.
#
# The alias target must be a route that actually exists in the app — these three
# map old draft-era paths onto the live menu slugs.

/menu/sushi-rolls  /menu/sushi  301
/menu/wok-noodles  /menu/wok  301
/menu/chicken-ramen-bowl  /menu/chicken-ramen  301
